{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_05",
  "title": "逃票？",
  "storyCode": "RS-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5a8b0292df31b609ead0065f08fb766b1d952be2f640f4a4fe5a6be43043d0c0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "拉住我的手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嗬——哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "之前在列车上有过一面之缘，没想到在这里还会被您所救。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "多亏了您伸出援手，否则我不知还要在这里被困多久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "我很感谢，罗莎琳·塔季扬诺夫娜·拉里娜小姐，感谢您的无私帮助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......唔，小事，不用谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你看起来肯定不是本地人，上山应该也是来旅游的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "正是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那你怎么不沿着大路走，跑到这种林子里来不说，还掉进人家打猎挖的陷阱里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "万一我没正好路过，你打算怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "我只是被山间的景色吸引，没有想到积雪之下会有这样的陷阱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "如果没有您路过解救......那我正好可以多待一会。冷静一下，再想办法自己爬出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "不过现在看来，我还是幸运的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "罗莎琳小姐，您是要继续上山吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嗯？对，没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "如果您不介意，我们可以同行一段。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "我也想要欣赏一番谢拉格雪山山顶的风光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我不介意，那我们走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "距离山顶还有好一段路程呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格老人",
      "text": "刚刚那是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格青年",
      "text": "莱利老爹！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格青年",
      "text": "我检查过了，咱们布置在这附近的陷阱被踩塌了一个，应该是有猎物掉进去过！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格青年",
      "text": "但我看的时候里头啥也没有，估计是又给逃了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格老人",
      "text": "你看到刚刚过去的那人没有？你看他，像不像图里尔那老小子说要找的那人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格青年",
      "text": "你是说，是锏小姐拜托我们找的那个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格老人",
      "text": "穿得乌漆嘛黑、装模作样的，戴着帽子还遮着脸，错不了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格老人",
      "text": "走！咱们回去，赶紧把这事告诉锏小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "喂，那个谁......对了，我还不知道你叫什么名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你们不是都讲究什么，见面要先互相告知姓名吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "这是我疏忽了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "鄙人名叫约翰·史密斯，随便您怎么称呼都可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "约翰......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你这名字......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "名字如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你这名字......听起来和之前博士看的什么间谍电影的主人公似的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "对，我没记错，就是这个名字！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我记得主人公还有个大美女搭档，约翰你......算了，看你能一个人来这种情侣景点，就知道你肯定没对象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "真是个有趣的巧合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "对吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "好了约翰，言归正传，我们估计还要爬一会才能到山顶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我听人说过，雪山越往上就越冷，而且还会让人越来越喘不上气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "怎么样，你累不累？要不要休息一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "请不必担心我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "罗莎琳小姐需要休息一下吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我就不用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "看来你的体力不错，“间谍先生”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "......哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "看来，他确实被你骗到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "我并没有编造谎言，锏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”是为公爵搜集情报的密探，一般的谎言瞒不过他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "但我深知，这种人往往最懂得“猜忌”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "“佩尔罗契家的继承人秘密归国”，这是他自己最先发现的事实，所以他一定会相信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "对方一定会盯上罗莎琳·塔季扬诺夫娜·拉里娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你总能猜对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "那女孩已经上山，菈塔托丝也联系了阿克托斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我接到消息，那个“灰礼帽”也跟上去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "他在躲着我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "无妨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "确认他将注意力放在那女孩身上就够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "你也该出发了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "好吧，就当饭后运动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "不过，你确定放任“灰礼帽”接近那个女孩，之后那个博士不会找你麻烦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”是间谍，不是杀手，他要的是情报，而不是性命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你打算这么向那个博士解释？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "博士那边我会向他——道歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你确实该道歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "我如何不重要，相比之下，我更好奇——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "锏，你也记住博士了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "Sharp作为对手来说还不错，比大部分草包骑士强得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "能被那样的战士推崇，又能让你吃点亏，这人记一记也无妨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "你对博士很好奇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "可以这么说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "好了，闲话就到这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我该干活了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "呀吼——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "终于到了——！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "呼，一共爬了有几个小时了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "累死我了，怪不得大家都选择留在山腰，这也太累人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "不过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "这里的风景确实不错......那边那个是不是银心湖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哈哈哈，从这看耶拉冈德像还没我拇指大！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "冬季的银心湖会冰封，从这里看下去，就像是一块色彩澄净的宝石一般。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "因此，谢拉格当地人都认为银心湖是耶拉冈德赐下的瑰宝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "确实是只有站得够高才能看到的风景。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "确实还挺像宝石的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哦，那边还能看到车站！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "这么看谢拉格的铁路也不少了嘛，就是列车看起来像玩具一样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "对于一个正在发展的国家来说，这样的铁道数量并不算多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "会看起来数量众多，只是因为这里是银心湖，还有耶拉冈德像在此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "虽然目前还不比圣山，但已经修建通车的铁道线路，都会途经这里，在此中转......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "......目前的线路都会在银心湖中转......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "别发呆了，约翰，帮我个忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "能帮我在这附近找找有没有长在一起的两棵树吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "应该是老树，枝干的部分缠在一起，形状看起来很奇怪的两棵树！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "乐意效劳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "谢了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "说起来，约翰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你都不问问我找树是要干啥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你是不是也没问过我，我上山是要干啥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我琢磨了一下......还是决定用我更擅长的办法解决问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "老实点别乱动！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "......罗莎琳小姐，您这是什么意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "别这副口吻，我还没把你怎么样呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "说吧，你暗中跟了我这么久，到山顶也没个动作，到底想干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "我不明白您的意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "少装傻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我不记得有告诉过你我的名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "......这是个误会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "您知道，我和哈洛德·克雷加文子爵阁下有旧，是他向我透露了罗莎琳小姐的姓名。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你是不是觉得我很好骗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我根本就没告诉那个大叔我的全名，他怎么可能告诉你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "而且你这家伙能一口气爬上山顶，连喘都不喘两声，根本不可能掉进普通猎人挖的陷阱！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "就算掉进去，也不至于上不来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "安娜她们总是要我多想想再行动，但要我说，有时候想太多反而没用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“约翰·史密斯”",
      "text": "您比我想的要细心许多，罗莎琳小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你这是承认了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "约翰·史密斯这个名字多半也是假的吧？难道说......你真是间谍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "如果我说我是呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那你这行一定干得不怎么样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "连我都能看出来不对劲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "您的指摘完全正确。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "实际上，我确实有许多大意之处，在谢拉格的生活让我有些疏于遮掩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "毕竟在谢拉格境内的行动还算自由，并且能够对我有所威胁的人，实在不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哈，口气不小。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我警告你，老实点，别想乱动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你现在可是在山崖边，脚下只有积雪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "只要我跺跺脚，这里的雪就会崩落，到时候我可不敢保证一定会拉住你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "好吧，罗莎琳小姐，那我也直说好了，你昨天......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "text": "维多利亚的小子！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "text": "阿克托斯在此！你给我离她远点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哇！你、你从哪冒出来的啊大叔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊等下！你别跺脚，等下——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哇啊啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "text": "罗、罗莎琳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "text": "抓住我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "虽然有些滑稽，但阿克托斯显然是冲着我来的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "难道说，罗莎琳真的是带着目的来到这座山上的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "无论如何，来都来了，只能跳了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......黑骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "休息好了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "还没。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "不太好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "打起来少点意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "这么直接？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "直接不好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "那么我也直接一点吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "你让哈洛德子爵相信，列车上的一切都是误会，当时我也只是半信半疑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "而现在，我知道了，原来堂堂黑骑士也会骗人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "那说明你对我的了解还远远不够。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "现在转身下山，还能好好吃一顿午饭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "抱歉，我一旦投入工作，就会废寝忘食。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
